      "content_license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "body": "For what purpose do you need to know how many months they&#39;re old? If it&#39;s just for inconsequential monthly celebrations, then when exactly you celebrate would also be inconsequential. If your doctor is asking, then they most likely don&#39;t expect a 100% perfect answer, or they would ask for the date of birth instead. If it&#39;s for another reason, it&#39;s probably going to depend on the context."
